0\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000libgcc_s_dw2-1.dll\u0000__register_frame_info\u0000__deregister_frame_info\u0000libgcj-16.dll\u0000_Jv_RegisterClasses\u0000\u0000./sandbox\u0000\u0000\u0000\n  DSA File Search Engine\n  Managing: %s\n  Indexed %lu entries in %.2f ms.  Type 'help' for commands, 'demo' for sample data.\n\n\u0000fse> \u0000\u0000\u0000DUPLICATE\u0000SAME-NAME\u0000  [%d] %-9s %-28s (via %s)\n\u0000/\u0000DIR\u0000\u0000FILE\u0000  %-4s %10s  %s  %s%s\n\u0000\u0000  ... and %lu more (refine your query or use limit=N)\n\u0000\u0000  -> %lu result(s), %s in files\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\n  Browsing\n    ls [path]                  list one folder\n    tree [path] [depth]        show the folder tree (default depth 3)\n    scan                       re-index the root folder\n    pwd                        show the managed root folder\n  Searching\n    find <exact_name>          O(1) exact filename lookup   (hash table)\n    search <prefix>            prefix search, case-insens.  (trie)\n    filter key=value ...       keys: ext= type=file|dir min= max= newer= older=\n                               contains= sort=name|size|date order=asc|desc limit=\n                               e.g.  filter ext=c min=1k sort=size\n                                     filter type=file newer=7 (modified in last 7 days)\n    dups                       find duplicate files by content\n    related <path>             files linked to this one (graph + BFS)\n    stats                      storage dashboard\n  Managing files\n    mkdir <path>               create folder (parents created as needed)\n    touch <path> [text...]     create a file, optionally with content\n    rename <path> <new>        rename in place (bare name) or move (path)\n    mv <path> <dest>           same as rename\n    rm [-r] [-f] <path>        delete a file / folder (-r recursive, -f no prompt)\n  Other\n    demo                       fill the root with sample files\n    help, exit\n\u0000.\u0000(none)\u0000built\u0000\u0000\u0000not built yet (built on first 'related')\u0000%s\u0000exit\u0000quit\u0000q\u0000help\u0000?\u0000pwd\u0000scan\u0000Indexed %lu entries (%s) in %.2f ms, max depth %d\n\u0000ls\u0000Invalid path.\u0000'%s' not found.\n\u0000%s/\n\u0000  (empty)\u0000tree\u0000'%s' is not a folder.\n\u0000find\u0000find <exact_name>\u0000Usage: %s\n\u0000\u0000\u0000No entry named exactly '%s'. (Try: search %.3s)\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000  -> %lu match(es) via hash table in %.1f us\n\u0000search\u0000search <prefix>\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000  (trie prefix search took %.1f us)\n\u0000filter\u0000Usage: filter key=value ...   (see 'help')\u0000\u0000Bad filter '%s' (expected key=value)\n\u0000%.*s\u0000ext\u0000type\u0000file\u0000dir\u0000type must be file or dir\u0000min\u0000\u0000\u0000Bad size for min= (try 500, 10k, 2m)\u0000max\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Bad size for max= (try 500, 10k, 2m)\u0000newer\u0000older\u0000contains\u0000sort\u0000name\u0000size\u0000date\u0000\u0000\u0000sort must be name, size or date\u0000order\u0000desc\u0000limit\u0000Unknown filter key '%s'\n\u0000dups\u0000No duplicate files found.\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000Group %lu: %lu identical copies of %s (wasting %s)\n\u0000    %s\n\u0000-> %lu group(s), %lu redundant file(s), %s reclaimable (%.1f%% of all file data)  [%.1f ms]\n\u0000related\u0000related <path>\u0000Files related to %s:\n\u0000  (none)\u0000stats\u0000dashboard\u0000\u0000\n==================== STORAGE DASHBOARD ====================\u0000 Root      : %s\n\u0000\u0000\u0000 Files     : %ld        Folders: %ld        Max depth: %d\n\u0000 Total size: %s\u0000        Average file: %s\u0000\n\u0000 By file type (by size)\u0000%s%s\u0000\u0000   %-8s %4ld file(s) %10s %5.1f%% \u0000   (no files)\u0000\n Largest files\u0000   %10s  %s\n\u0000\n Largest folders\u0000   %10s  %s/\n\u0000\n Recently modified\u0000   %s  %s\n\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\n