    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-30T10:36:20.710Z",
    "content": "#ifndef DUPES_H\n#define DUPES_H\n#include \"common.h\"\n#include \"filelist.h\"\n\ntypedef struct { FileRecord **members; size_t count; long long size; } DupGroup;\ntypedef struct { DupGroup *groups; size_t count; size_t extra_files; long long wasted; } DupSet;\n\n/* Duplicate detection: group by size -> hash contents (FNV-1a) only where sizes\n   collide -> byte-compare to confirm. Avoids reading most files at all. */\nvoid dup_find(const char *root, const FileList *l, DupSet *out);\nvoid dup_free(DupSet *d);\n#endif\n"
  },
