    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-30T10:36:21.049Z",
    "content": "#ifndef HASHTABLE_H\n#define HASHTABLE_H\n#include \"common.h\"\n\n/* Separate-chaining hash table: filename -> records. Auto-resizes at 0.75 load.\n   Exact filename lookup is O(1) average. */\ntypedef struct HNode { const char *key; FileRecord *rec; struct HNode *next; } HNode;\ntypedef struct { HNode **buckets; size_t cap, count; } HashTable;\n\nvoid ht_init(HashTable *h, size_t cap);\nvoid ht_insert(HashTable *h, FileRecord *r);\nvoid ht_lookup(const HashTable *h, const char *name, RecVec *out);\nvoid ht_stats(const HashTable *h, size_t *used, size_t *max_chain);\nvoid ht_free(HashTable *h);\n#endif\n"
  },
